# SumUp
# QuantumultX filter_remote rule
# Usage: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<your-username>/<your-repo>/main/sumup.list, tag=SumUp, force-policy=PROXY, update-interval=86400, opt-parser=true, enabled=true
HOST-SUFFIX,sumup.com
HOST-SUFFIX,sumup.co.uk
HOST-SUFFIX,sumup.me
HOST-SUFFIX,sumup-mkt.com
HOST-SUFFIX,sumup-analytics.com
HOST-KEYWORD,sumup
